/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Exported logs from local runs
/logs-export/
*.log

# Local cluster / kubeconfig artifacts — never commit cluster credentials.
# `kind get kubeconfig > kubeconfig.yaml` is this project's own idiom and
# produces a stageable cluster-admin credential, so cover the suffixed and
# prefixed spellings as well as the bare name. `*kubeconfig*` rather than a
# prefix/suffix pair because the substring can land in the middle
# (`kind-kubeconfig.yaml`). No bare `config` pattern: it would ignore
# legitimate files.
*kubeconfig*
admin.conf
.kube/
